# Placeholder for synheart-flux native libraries
#
# Place libsynheart_flux.so files in the architecture-specific subdirectories:
# - arm64-v8a/libsynheart_flux.so (64-bit ARM)
# - armeabi-v7a/libsynheart_flux.so (32-bit ARM)
# - x86/libsynheart_flux.so (32-bit x86)
# - x86_64/libsynheart_flux.so (64-bit x86)
#
# Build from synheart-flux repository:
#   cd synheart-flux
#   bash scripts/build-android.sh dist/android
#
# Then copy the .so files to this directory.
